{'Parameters': 'interval', 'Info': 'Specifies the minimum interval at which routing updates are sent.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 600, in seconds. The value 0 indicates that the device immediately sends BGP Update messages to notify its peers of route changes.'}
